# The Chatterbox-Turbo env (modules/voice/crissa_voice/turbo_setup.py): Resemble AI's Chatterbox-Turbo on an NVIDIA
# GPU (code and weights MIT; weights fetched at install by hash). torch 2.11 with CUDA 12.8 (Blackwell included):
# chatterbox-tts 0.1.7 pins torch 2.6, which has no sm_120 kernels, so turbo-overrides.txt lifts that pin and drops
# the package's pykakasi (GPL-3, Japanese only), gradio (its demo UI) and spacy-pkuseg (Chinese only).
# resemble-perth is Resemble's Perth watermarker: it stamps every clip (turbo.settings.watermark, on by default).
